"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IBERYA_MAGRIB:0757-05-25:0":{"b": ["The Sufri Kharijites seized Kairouan", "e215c08e"], "d": ["After the Umayyad governorship of Ifriqiya collapsed, Kairouan was seized in 140 (757) by Asim al-Warfajumi of the Sufri Kharijites.", "a8302c5a"]},
