"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IRAN_HINT_MAGRIB:0972-07-01:0":{"b": ["Hasan al-A'sam reoccupied Ramla and defeated a strong Fatimid army", "c3b5ad80"], "d": ["The Qarmatian leader Hasan al-A'sam reoccupied Ramla in Ramadan 361 (July 972) and defeated a strong Fatimid army; a year later he attacked Egypt by land and sea and besieged Cairo once more, but was defeated by al-Aziz Billah.", "f629e2e1"]},
"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IRAN_HINT_MAGRIB:0981-01-01:0":{"b": ["The Chinese envoy Wang Yande began traveling among the Uyghurs (981-984); his report is the main source on Turfan Uyghur culture.", "478d801b"], "d": ["The Chinese envoy Wang Yande began traveling among the Uyghurs (981-984); his report is the main source on Turfan Uyghur culture.", "478d801b"]},
