"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IRAN_HINT_MAGRIB:1127-01-17:0":{"b": ["Sultan Sanjar besieged Alamut; the fortress could not be taken", "6b06eb0c"], "d": ["The Seljuk Sultan Sanjar besieged Alamut, the center of the Nizari Isma'ilis, in 521 (1127); the conquest of the fortress proved impossible.", "91215716"]},
