"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IRAN_HINT_MAGRIB:1130-01-01:2":{"b": ["Umm Fatik Alam has the vizier Mannallah killed and appoints Zurayq as vizier (524).", "10dcdc3d"], "d": ["Umm Fatik Alam has the vizier Mannallah killed and appoints Zurayq as vizier (524).", "10dcdc3d"]},
"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IRAN_HINT_MAGRIB:1137-01-01:0":{"b": ["Fatik II is killed; Fatik III b. Muhammad becomes ruler and Surur vizier (531).", "2f2d69ac"], "d": ["Fatik II is killed; Fatik III b. Muhammad becomes ruler and Surur vizier (531).", "2f2d69ac"]},
"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IRAN_HINT_MAGRIB:1141-01-01:0":{"b": ["After the victory at Qatwan, the Khwarazmshahs accepted vassalage to the Qara Khitai and agreed to pay tribute", "5719a5ee"], "d": ["After the Qara Khitai defeated Sanjar at Qatwan and became masters of all Transoxiana, the Khwarazmshahs in the same year likewise became vassals of the Qara Khitai and agreed to pay tribute (30,000 dinars a year). This vassalage lasted until 1173, when Tekish came to the throne of Khwarazm with Qara Khitai support.", "ab6f992b"]},
"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IRAN_HINT_MAGRIB:1141-01-01:1":{"b": ["The last Kakuyid died in the battle of Qatwan; the Atabegs of Yazd took their place in Yazd", "272bdc16"], "d": ["The last Kakuyid died in the battle of Qatwan; the Atabegs of Yazd took their place in Yazd", "272bdc16"]},
"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IRAN_HINT_MAGRIB:1142-02-01:0":{"b": ["The Gurkhan Yelu Dashi died; his wife Kuyang (Tubuyan) succeeded him", "29e8156e"], "d": ["The first Qara Khitai ruler, the Gurkhan Yelu Dashi (1130-1142), died in February 1142 (or 1143); he was succeeded in turn by his wife Tubuyan (Kuyang), his son Yelu Yilie, his sister Yelu Shi, or the regent Pusuwan. With the victory of Qatwan (1141), all Transoxiana and Khwarazm had been made tributary.", "5412642d"]},
"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IRAN_HINT_MAGRIB:1150-01-01:0":{"b": ["Umm Fatik Alam died; Surur gathered all authority in his hands (545).", "5a5e3fcd"], "d": ["Umm Fatik Alam died; Surur gathered all authority in his hands (545).", "5a5e3fcd"]},
